    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 42733cf9febab2e5aa29d3f001aa659afbd0eb41 -->\nReview (independent, test-only): clean.\n\n- Rename is complete: no `PR1`/`PF1` remains in `crates/app/tests/lathe_field_sim.rs` except in the explanatory comment. The labels R1/S1 match the `lathe_post` fixture.\n- Assertion is right. `CreateOperation` writes no `OperationMeta` (only `PasteOperation` and `DeleteOperation` do), so both ops have position `u32::MAX`. Both use the same tool, so the setup rank ties too. `operation_order` then falls to the stable key, and `named_entities` sorts by name, giving `[R1, S1]`. The assertion holds, and it checks the fixture's premise, not the bug itself.\n- Fixes #186 is the right closing keyword for a test-only fix. Clippy/readings are claimed in the PR body and not re-run here.",
